# JobPilot AI — Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in values from the Supabase dashboard
(Project Settings → API).

```bash
cp .env.example .env.local
```

## Required for Supabase client (browser)

```
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
```

## Optional — CLI only (never expose to Vite)

Personal access token for JobPilot Management API / CLI deploy.
Stored per-project so `supabase login` on another account does not wipe JobPilot auth.

```
SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=sbp_...
```

Create via: `npm run supabase:login`  
Then run CLI as: `npm run supabase -- <command>`

Never commit real keys. `.env` and `.env.local` are gitignored.
